{"id":"en_the-war-for-a-stolen-tradition-2","title":"The War for a Stolen Tradition 2","titleEn":"The War for a Stolen Tradition 2","description":"Two centuries ago, the Dream Kingdom seized the sacred legacy of Nuo Opera. Serena broke her own divine spirit to shield her people, sending its fragments through time, while Lawrence entered the time tunnel to recover what she had lost. In the present day, a piece of that spirit is reborn during the Nuo Festival as Stella, a four-year-old who grows up performing Nuo Opera. Fifteen years later, the Dream Wave threatens to cancel the festival. As Stella is about to be forced off the ritual stage while defending it, Serena appears, looking exactly like her, and rescues her.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-war-for-a-stolen-tradition-2/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-war-for-a-stolen-tradition-2/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Deity / God","Expose & Defeat","Fantasy","Return of the Strong","Town","Comeback"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diu28/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-war-for-a-stolen-tradition-2_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diu28/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-war-for-a-stolen-tradition-2_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diu28/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-war-for-a-stolen-tradition-2_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diu28/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-war-for-a-stolen-tradition-2_